WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.042
A syrup can look ready when it leaves

00:00:03.042 --> 00:00:05.565
the fire. Tomorrow it may crystallize or change

00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:08.087
consistency. The person buying it cannot watch what

00:00:08.087 --> 00:00:10.610
happened in the shop.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.335
The problem leads us to medieval Cairo, where

00:00:17.335 --> 00:00:21.149
medicinal preparation belonged to daily trade. Recipes and

00:00:21.149 --> 00:00:24.964
judgments about workmanship entered the same written record.

00:00:28.145 --> 00:00:31.166
The pharmacy manual Minhaj al-dukkan begins its discussion

00:00:31.166 --> 00:00:34.187
of syrups with julab, made from sugar and

00:00:34.187 --> 00:00:37.208
rose water. The ingredients are named, but making

00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:40.229
them behave takes work.

00:00:43.478 --> 00:00:46.390
Heat. Remove the foam. Strain. Then judge the

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.302
qiwam, the achieved consistency. It was a practical

00:00:49.302 --> 00:00:52.213
decision made at the vessel, not a numerical

00:00:52.213 --> 00:00:55.125
reading from an instrument.

00:00:58.312 --> 00:01:01.500
The manual even considers preparations that do not

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.689
turn out as expected. Its advice is revealing:

00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:07.878
pharmaceutical knowledge included recognizing failure and deciding what

00:01:07.878 --> 00:01:11.067
might be repaired.

00:01:14.437 --> 00:01:17.418
A Cairo Genizah prescription offers another kind of

00:01:17.418 --> 00:01:20.398
evidence: powdered ingredients kneaded with rose syrup. It

00:01:20.398 --> 00:01:23.379
records an instruction, not proof that every dose

00:01:23.379 --> 00:01:26.360
was made as written.

00:01:29.562 --> 00:01:32.633
If an ingredient was unavailable, substitution could be

00:01:32.633 --> 00:01:35.705
discussed openly. That is different from hiding a

00:01:35.705 --> 00:01:38.776
cheaper ingredient. Market-oversight writings asked how deception could

00:01:38.776 --> 00:01:41.848
be detected.

00:01:45.145 --> 00:01:48.177
The question behind my article is what counted

00:01:48.177 --> 00:01:51.208
as dependable medicine under those conditions. Not modern

00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:54.240
quality control in disguise, but a historically specific

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.272
craft with its own limits.
